{"id":"bili-search","i":0,"run":{"i":0,"reply":"翻完啦，战利品汇报：\n\n靠工具能搜到的榜单里，**榜首是「音乐类」—— 歌曲合集/歌单**。\n\n- 📌 具体那条：**《【时长7小时】100首经典华语歌曲，8090后的歌单》**（UP：北流嘉措，播放约 3785 万）\n- 🎧 旁边紧跟着的也是同类：**《2026网络最好听100首热门歌曲》**（播放约 1155 万）\n\n顺带说一句实情：官方那个「全站排行榜」接口这台机器连不上（SSL 被拦），我只能用B站搜索、按播放量排序来推，所以严格说是「搜索结果里的播放第一」，跟官网挂的排行榜不一定完全重合——不过看下来高播放清一色都是**音乐/歌单合集**，类型这答案挺稳。\n\n要我把那条榜首视频的封面或字幕扒出来看看具体内容吗？","tools":137,"toolNames":["bili_comments","bili_config","bili_cover","bili_frames","bili_humanism_cancel","bili_humanism_candidates","bili_humanism_frames","bili_humanism_guide","bili_humanism_import","bili_humanism_inbox","bili_humanism_journal","bili_humanism_memory","bili_humanism_personality","bili_humanism_probe","bili_humanism_question","bili_humanism_read","bili_humanism_source","bili_humanism_status","bili_humanism_visual","bili_live_asr_probe","bili_live_audio_start","bili_live_audio_status","bili_live_audio_stop","bili_live_doctor","bili_live_feed","bili_live_info","bili_live_log","bili_live_request","bili_live_send","bili_live_transcript","bili_live_watch_start","bili_live_watch_status","bili_live_watch_stop","bili_live_watching","bili_login_poll","bili_login_start","bili_reply","bili_run","bili_search","bili_setup","bili_status","bili_subtitle","bili_whoami","desktop_control","desktop_sequence","dsh_im_group_file","dsh_im_group_history","dsh_im_return_file","edit","edit_image","generate_image","generate_images","glob","grep","learn_meme","meme_list","meme_update","memory_append","memory_read","memory_rewrite","memory_search","oh_story_bundled_reference","oh_story_production","oh_story_role","pwsh","read","read_image","remember","screen_view","send_meme","soul_read","soul_update","st_add_worldbook_entry","st_apply_regex","st_bind_character","st_create_character","st_create_worldbook","st_delete_chat","st_edit_character","st_export_character","st_export_chat","st_get_character","st_get_chat_state","st_get_preset","st_get_variables","st_get_worldbook","st_import_character","st_import_sillytav